<title>USA: Physician Corp sets Sept 8 special meeting.</title>
<headline>Physician Corp sets Sept 8 special meeting.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physician Corp of America said Monday it has scheduled a special shareholders meeting for September 8 to consider and vote on its merger deal with Humana Inc.</p>
<p>A definitive proxy statement regarding the special meeting was filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on August 8, Physician Corp said.</p>
<p>It said it set July 25 as the record date for shareholders entitled to vote at the meeting.</p>
</text>
